# Doubling is +X/+0 for the power the creature has as the spell resolves (CR 701.10b), not as it was cast. Bot1 casts Bulk Up
# at Bot2's Llanowar Elves (power 1), then a second Bulk Up on top of it while the first is on the stack. The second resolves
# first (1 -> 2), then the first (2 -> 4). At the next turn's start the effects have ended with the turn (CR 514.2) and the
# Elves is a 1/1 again.

